{"name":"Millennial Pink","hex":"#f6c8c1","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"millennial pink","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A light rosy pink colour."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a light rosy pink colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/millennial_pink"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shades of pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink colors are usually light or desaturated shades of reds, roses, and magentas which are created on computer and television screens using the RGB color model and in printing with the CMYK color model. As such, it is an arbitrary classification of color."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Color_icon_pink_v2.svg/330px-Color_icon_pink_v2.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shades_of_pink","wikidata":"Q19847189"},{"title":"Millennials","blocks":[{"text":"Millennials, also known as Generation Y or Gen Y, are the demographic cohort following Generation X and preceding Generation Z. Researchers and popular media use the early 1980s as starting birth years and the mid-1990s to early 2000s as ending birth years, with the generation typically being defined as people born from 1981 to 1996. Most millennials are the children of baby boomers and older Gen Xers, and are often the parents of younger Generation Z and Generation Alpha."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Generation_timeline_simple.svg/330px-Generation_timeline_simple.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Millennials","wikidata":"Q277633"},{"title":"Pink","blocks":[{"text":"Pink is a pale tint of red or rose, the color of the pink flower. It was first used as a color name in the late 17th century. A combination of pink and white is associated with innocence, whereas a combination of pink and black links to eroticism and seduction."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg/330px-Pink_sapphire_ring.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pink","wikidata":"Q429220"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Globe_amaranth.jpg/500px-Globe_amaranth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/05/Globe_amaranth.jpg/500px-Globe_amaranth.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Pink globe amaranth","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGlobe_amaranth.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg/500px-Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg/1280px-Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c9/Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg/500px-Row_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cherry blossoms blooming in the spring in Japan","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARow_of_sakura%2C_Asuwa_River%2C_Fukui.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/2014-05-10_12_34_11_Flowering_Cherry_along_New_Jersey_Route_29_in_Hopewell_Township%2C_New_Jersey.JPG/500px-2014-05-10_12_34_11_Flowering_Cherry_along_New_Jersey_Route_29_in_Hopewell_Township%2C_New_Jersey.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/2014-05-10_12_34_11_Flowering_Cherr